    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calm on the surface, but rich underneath.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dignaut</strong> is a chill-but-deep sci-fi digging sim where you explore alien terrain using advanced tools, extract valuable resources, and uncover strange tech beneath the surface of a mysterious planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone recruit sent by a profit-hungry megacorp to a newly scanned world deemed \u201chighly promising\u201d by corporate AI. Your mission: dig, transmit, upgrade. The tools start simple, but evolve fast. So do the discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you\u2019ll unlock new equipment, send rare finds back to the corporation, and improve your arsenal. Every upgrade brings new layers of strategy \u2014 and reveals secrets the company wasn\u2019t expecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built with the community, Dignaut grows with every update</strong> \u2014 with new biomes, tools, challenges, and surprises inspired by player feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade and evolve your tools with modular sci-fi tech<br>\ud83d\udcbc Send resources and relics back to HQ for credits and performance XP<br>\ud83e\udde9 Discover secrets buried beneath strange alien biomes<br>\ud83d\udd04 Modular progression with flexible paths and playstyles<br>\ud83d\udc65 Community-driven development with regular updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were sent to dig. Now you decide how deep this goes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Calm on the surface, but rich underneath.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dignaut</strong> is a chill-but-deep sci-fi digging sim where you explore alien terrain using advanced tools, extract valuable resources, and uncover strange tech beneath the surface of a mysterious planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone recruit sent by a profit-hungry megacorp to a newly scanned world deemed \u201chighly promising\u201d by corporate AI. Your mission: dig, transmit, upgrade. The tools start simple, but evolve fast. So do the discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you\u2019ll unlock new equipment, send rare finds back to the corporation, and improve your arsenal. Every upgrade brings new layers of strategy \u2014 and reveals secrets the company wasn\u2019t expecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built with the community, Dignaut grows with every update</strong> \u2014 with new biomes, tools, challenges, and surprises inspired by player feedback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade and evolve your tools with modular sci-fi tech<br>\ud83d\udcbc Send resources and relics back to HQ for credits and performance XP<br>\ud83e\udde9 Discover secrets buried beneath strange alien biomes<br>\ud83d\udd04 Modular progression with flexible paths and playstyles<br>\ud83d\udc65 Community-driven development with regular updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were sent to dig. Now you decide how deep this goes.</p>",
